      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the purpose of the \"obj\" targets?  \"obj\" is very specific to native code, and seems a little strange to implement in the common module code.  Is there something more generic that could be used across multiple module types that should be implemented here?  If it\u0027s just for native code, maybe it should be in a singleton in cc?",
